Loans development script 01 completed.

Scope:
- loans table
- loan_payments history table
- borrowed and given directions
- BIGINT minor-unit amounts
- optional interest-rate metadata
- optional payment schedule metadata
- RLS ownership isolation
- idempotent create_loan RPC
- idempotent add_loan_payment RPC
- overpayment prevention
- automatic settled status when principal reaches zero
- deterministic remaining-principal calculation
- loan status RPC
- payment history RPC
- TypeScript/Zod contracts
- bound Supabase service adapter
- TanStack Query hooks
- interest formatting helpers

Important:
- no automatic interest accrual was invented
- loan payments do not mutate the account ledger
- remaining balance is derived from principal minus payment history

No tests were run.
Run Loans development script 02 before validation.